From 7f0462b32a6cc82c1727888da87d7a6207a7659f Mon Sep 17 00:00:00 2001
From: =?UTF-8?q?Maxime=20M=C3=A9r=C3=A9?= <maxime.mere@foss.st.com>
Date: Thu, 4 Jun 2026 19:19:46 +0200
Subject: [PATCH 530/572] fix(stm32mp2): set FWU boot index before BL2 DT is
 overwritten
MIME-Version: 1.0
Content-Type: text/plain; charset=UTF-8
Content-Transfer-Encoding: 8bit

stm32_fwu_set_boot_idx() may fail when called late from the BL33 image
handling path, as the FWU information lookup still relies on device tree
data that is no longer accessible once the BL2 DT area has been
overwritten by BL31.

Move the FWU boot index update to the FW_CONFIG handling path so it is
performed while the BL2 DT is still available, and avoid the resulting
panic.

Upstream-Status: Inappropriate [ST downstream https://github.com/STMicroelectronics/arm-trusted-firmware.git 01b8d16ab85cf2ba2f1c4979e3b4db1ce780f4ca fix(stm32mp2): set FWU boot index before BL2 DT is overwritten]
Change-Id: Ieec942f0d55cbe2f5bd4a64275af6798f52a0502
Signed-off-by: Maxime Méré <maxime.mere@foss.st.com>
Reviewed-on: https://gerrit.st.com/c/mpu/oe/st/tf-a/+/574939
ACI: CIBUILD <MDG-smet-aci-builds@list.st.com>
Domain-Review: Yann GAUTIER <yann.gautier@foss.st.com>
Reviewed-by: Yann GAUTIER <yann.gautier@foss.st.com>
Reviewed-on: https://gerrit.st.com/c/mpu/oe/st/tf-a/+/579560
---
 plat/st/stm32mp2/bl2_plat_setup.c | 19 +++++++++----------
 1 file changed, 9 insertions(+), 10 deletions(-)

diff --git a/plat/st/stm32mp2/bl2_plat_setup.c b/plat/st/stm32mp2/bl2_plat_setup.c
index f3d776a602..27db8f01ea 100644
--- a/plat/st/stm32mp2/bl2_plat_setup.c
+++ b/plat/st/stm32mp2/bl2_plat_setup.c
@@ -805,6 +805,15 @@ int bl2_plat_handle_post_image_load(unsigned int image_id)
 		}
 #endif
 
+#if PSA_FWU_SUPPORT
+		/* This must be done before the device tree unmapped */
+		err = stm32_fwu_set_boot_idx();
+		if (err != 0) {
+			ERROR("FWU: Failed to set boot index\n");
+			panic();
+		}
+#endif /* PSA_FWU_SUPPORT */
+
 		/*
 		 * After this step, the BL2 device tree area will be overwritten
 		 * with BL31 binary, no other data should be read from BL2 DT.
@@ -849,16 +858,6 @@ int bl2_plat_handle_post_image_load(unsigned int image_id)
 		}
 		break;
 #endif
-
-	case BL33_IMAGE_ID:
-#if PSA_FWU_SUPPORT
-		err = stm32_fwu_set_boot_idx();
-		if (err != 0) {
-			panic();
-		}
-#endif /* PSA_FWU_SUPPORT */
-		break;
-
 	default:
 		/* Do nothing in default case */
 		break;
-- 
